=== Museum Milestones ===
For every {{SBXP|100}}, the player is granted one {{Green|Museum Milestone}}. These give a {{Aqua|+1% Bits Multiplier}} and increase your [[Bank]] interest by {{Gold|+2%}}: some milestones give bonus rewards, like [[Bank#Bank Upgrades|Bank Upgrades]].

