== Trivia ==
*There was a window of time, ending with October 15, 2024 during which it was possible to donate items that shared the name of an armor set as an alternative to the full set of armor. This was possible with: {{Item|Pumpkin}} as {{Item|Pumpkin Armor|image=Pumpkin Helmet}}, {{Item|Cactus}} as {{Item|Cactus Armor}}, {{Item|Glacite}} as {{Item|Glacite Armor}}, {{Item|Melon}} as {{Item|Melon Armor|image=Melon Helmet}}, {{Item|Cropie}} as {{Item|Cropie Armor}}, {{Item|Squash}} as {{Item|Squash Armor}}, {{Item|Sponge}} as {{Item|Sponge Armor}}, {{Item|Sorrow}} as {{Item|Sorrow Armor}} and {{Item|Fermento}} as {{Item|Fermento Armor}}.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/possibly-the-funniest-bug-just-got-fixed.5786577</ref>
**This was not possible with items such as {{Item|Lapis Lazuli}}, because its armor set is called {{Item|Lapis Armor}}, rather than Lapis Lazuli Armor. Similarly it didn't work with {{Item|Emerald}} because its armor is called {{Item|Emerald Armor Helmet}} and not just "Emerald Helmet".
**Donating these items would soulbound them and store them in the museum.

